9le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's it! Enough is enough!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally! What's wrong? You haven't told off someone else on the bus, have you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ha ha. No. But my week is the pits. That I haven't completely lost it is a miracle!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Get it all off your chest. I'm all ears. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So I met with my boss and I printed some information about emotional intelligence and I gave it to her. What she needs is to increase her emotional intelligence.", "id": 1}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn9le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You didn't tell her that, did you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No! I'm not deranged, am I?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So how did she respond to you? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not well. What she thought was that I was criticizing her. I tried to explain the concept and that when people have emotional intelligence, they function better and achieve more in the work environment.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She didn't want to listen, did she? She doesn't seem like she's very receptive to change.", "id": 2}, {"time": "55000", "image": "engenn9le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No. She was really resistant to hearing what I had to say. She made me feel really insignificant. In fact, what she said was that I was wasting her time. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally, the important thing is that you are making an effort to improve yourself. You attempted to share your enthusiasm with the wrong person. It's her loss, isn't it?  You just have to let it go.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right. Who I have to feel good about is helping myself! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's the spirit!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}